===Etymology===
From {{af|en|cross-|link}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|chemistry}} A [[covalent bond]] (or series of bonds) between adjacent chains of a [[polymer]]
# {{lb|en|biochemistry}} A similar bond between [[strand]]s of [[nucleic acid]]
# {{lb|en|Internet}} An internal [[hyperlink]] to another [[webpage]] belonging to the same web [[domain name|domain]].
#: {{hypernyms|en|hyperlink}}

